'''Chroma Cookiecane''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2022 Christmas Box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2022|2022 Christmas Event]].  It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
It resembles a marauder cutlass sword with a Christmas appearance to it. Its blade is made out of a brown cookie with color alternating sprinkles and white frosting as the edge. The spine of the blade is constructed out of a color-alternating candy cane. The guard is golden with curved quillons, and like the spine, the handle is made out of a wavy color alternating candy cane with a color alternating peppermint pommel, attached using a golden prong.

==Trivia==
*It is the [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart of the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife under the name [[Cookiecane]], which was found in the same box.
*It is the sixth holiday chroma and the third Christmas chroma to be released inside the game, the others being [[Chroma Evergreen]], [[Chroma Evergun]], [[Chroma Traveler's Gun]], [[Chroma Elderwood Blade]], [[Chroma Swirly Gun]], [[Chroma Candleflame]], [[Chroma Gingerblade]] and [[Chroma Boneblade]].
*Like all the other [[Chroma Weapons]], it is not salvageable in the crafting station.
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*There was a bug that lasted over two weeks where this knife appeared as Chroma Gingermint with no image in a player’s inventory. This was clearly unintended as Chroma Gingermint does not actually exist. This issue was resolved on January 7th, 2023.
*It was an item that was secretly duped and overcirculated causing it to lose a lot of its value
*'''Chroma Cookiecane''' is slightly bigger than its counterpart, [[Cookiecane]]. 

